click 320 240 0.18 0.6 probe-1
wait 0.8
click 200 260 0.18 0.6 probe-2
wait 0.8
click 440 220 0.18 0.6 probe-3
wait 0.8
click 320 360 0.18 0.6 probe-4
wait 0.8
